\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces The ULAL pipeline. Video is split by source group (no leakage); a ResNet50+LSTM teacher is trained on the base classes, extended to new classes by continual learning, compressed into a MobileNet student by distillation, and finally adapted to brand-new few-shot classes with MAML. The capstone notebook (\S  \ref  {sec:ulal}) chains the best choice from each stage.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
